\newlabel{tab:local-info}{{III}{9}{Local FILD/FILA information in ZeBRA-defined control-FPR bands. Both directional conditional LRTs are shown so the asymmetry between channels is explicit. These local summaries are descriptive rather than multiplicity-adjusted confirmatory tests}{table.3}{}}
